# Blueline Transport — environment variables (all optional)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Copy this file to `.env.local` (which is git-ignored) and fill in real values.
# The site works with NONE of these set — the contact form defaults to opening
# WhatsApp with the load details pre-filled, which needs no key.

# OPTIONAL: switch the contact form to email delivery via Web3Forms.
# Get a free access key at https://web3forms.com and uncomment the email path
# in src/components/ContactSection.tsx (handleSubmit).
# This is a public, submit-only key — safe for client-side use.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=your-web3forms-access-key
